# Audio fixtures (vkstorm-vorbis, vkstorm-audio)
*.ogg binary
*.oga binary
*.ogv binary
*.opus binary
*.mp2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.aac binary
*.flac binary
*.m4a binary
